<view class="page">
  <view class="topline">
    <text class="kicker">MY / LISTINGS</text>
    <text class="kicker" bindtap="goMarket">公开浏览 ›</text>
  </view>

  <view class="my-head">
    <view class="my-title">我的<text class="title-it">发布</text></view>
    <view class="my-sub">审核通过后会出现在公开浏览，可直接分享小程序卡片</view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="empty">加载中…</view>
  <view wx:elif="{{errorText}}" class="empty">
    <view>{{errorText}}</view>
    <view class="btn btn-ghost" bindtap="load">重试</view>
  </view>
  <view wx:elif="{{!listings.length}}" class="empty">
    <view class="empty-title">还没有发布</view>
    <view class="empty-copy">先选一台设备，生成信息后再带实拍图发布。</view>
    <view class="btn btn-primary" bindtap="goPublish">去发布</view>
  </view>

  <view class="record-list">
    <view wx:for="{{listings}}" wx:key="id" class="record-card card-surface">
      <image class="record-cover" src="{{item.cover}}" mode="aspectFill" />
      <view class="record-body" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="open">
        <view class="record-top">
          <text class="record-title">{{item.title}}</text>
          <text class="status status-{{item.status}}">{{item.statusText}}</text>
        </view>
        <view class="record-model">{{item.model_name}} · {{item.variant_label}}</view>
        <view class="record-foot">
          <text class="record-price">{{item.priceText}}</text>
          <text class="record-del" data-id="{{item.id}}" catchtap="remove">删除</text>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="my-note">
    <view>审核由后台完成；未通过的发布不会出现在公开浏览。</view>
    <view>本工具不提供交易、支付、评论或私聊。</view>
  </view>
</view>
